14
00:00:37.145 --> 00:00:39.495
&lt;i&gt;LANDRU: Consommez les intrus ! &lt;i&gt; L’Obey Landru !&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/i &gt;

15
00:00:39.538 --> 00:00:42.889
